{"id":"960197535160cece","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-orthexist.md","title":"Existence of an orthogonal DNF","display":"thm-orthexist — Existence of an orthogonal DNF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-orthexist","aliases":["27-thm-orthexist"],"display":"thm-orthexist — Existence of an orthogonal DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-orthdnf]]","[[27-df-orthogonalize]]"],"local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-orthexist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-orthexist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-orthexist — Existence of an orthogonal DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5db086b596a0f700\" href=\"?note=5db086b596a0f700\" title=\"27-df-orthdnf\">27-df-orthdnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c3b82c1fc896440\" href=\"?note=0c3b82c1fc896440\" title=\"27-df-orthogonalize\">27-df-orthogonalize</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5db086b596a0f700\" href=\"?note=5db086b596a0f700\" title=\"27-df-orthdnf\">27-df-orthdnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c3b82c1fc896440\" href=\"?note=0c3b82c1fc896440\" title=\"27-df-orthogonalize\">27-df-orthogonalize</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\;\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\;\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.1，印刷页 327–329，PDF 第 351–353 页（从 1 计数）。本地存在性证明可直接取 f=EvalDNF_n(D) 的全部真点最小项：对每个 a∈B^n 且 f(a)=1，取在每个坐标 i 固定 x_i=a_i 的一致项。该项的真点集恰为 {a}；不同 a 的项两两正交，其析取恰为 f。布尔立方体有限，故这些项组成合法 E；f=0 时取 E=∅。n=0 时只有一个赋值，其最小项就是空项。此证明不要求实现书中递归算法，也不声称多项式输出规模。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthdnf","status":"resolved","id":"5db086b596a0f700","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-orthdnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthogonalize","status":"resolved","id":"0c3b82c1fc896440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-orthogonalize]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthogonalize]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthdnf","status":"resolved","id":"5db086b596a0f700","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthogonalize]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthogonalize","status":"resolved","id":"0c3b82c1fc896440","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthogonalize]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\;\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n(D,E)","display":true}],"bytes":1313,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-484","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-orthexist|thm-orthexist — Existence of an orthogonal DNF]]"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","5db086b596a0f700","0c3b82c1fc896440"]}